   "properties": {
    "id": "SUP A255/26 ROZ TMA BAIRES",
    "category": "tempRestricted",
    "qcode": null,
    "location": "TMA BAIRES · FIR EZEIZA",
    "validFrom": "2026-11-08T13:00:00Z",
    "validTo": "2026-11-11T19:00:00Z",
    "permanent": false,
    "schedule": "8 NOV 13:00Z-sunset; 9 NOV 11:00Z-20:00Z; 10 NOV 09:30Z-12:00Z and 18:00Z-21:30Z; 11 NOV 10:00Z-19:00Z",
    "lower": {
     "text": "GND",
     "feet": 0,
     "reference": "GND"
    },
    "upper": {
     "text": "FL245",
     "feet": 24500,
     "reference": "FL"
    },
    "text": "SUP A 258/26 and SUP A 255/26 (ANAC) - VISIT OF POPE LEO XIV, 08-11 NOV 2026. RESTRICTED OPERATION ZONE (ROZ) TMA BAIRES, GND-FL245, over the lateral limits of the TMA BAIRES, 08-11 NOV: operations are supervised by the COAe; aircraft that do not comply are treated as irregular air traffic (Decree 1334/2026). Operations are suspended at uncontrolled public and private aerodromes and heliports, LAD and LADH inside the area, also flight instruction, local flights and recreational/sport activities (parachuting, gliders, balloons, paragliders); UAS/RPAS are prohibited; Moron (SADM) and heliport Dr. Alfredo Lanari have their own restrictions. Periods (UTC): 8 NOV 13:00Z-sunset; 9 NOV 11:00Z-20:00Z; 10 NOV 09:30Z-12:00Z and 18:00Z-21:30Z; 11 NOV 10:00Z-19:00Z (local time = UTC-3). On 11 NOV the ROZ also applies (10:00Z-19:00Z), with the FAOR MERCEDES military area. Aeroparque (SABE), Ezeiza (SAEZ) and Cordoba (SACO) have their own closure windows: see SUP A 255/26 section 2. Read the SUPs for the full text. Reference only, not an official NOTAM.",
    "textEs": "SUP A 258/26 y SUP A 255/26 (ANAC) - VISITA DEL PAPA LEON XIV, 08-11 NOV 2026. ZONA DE OPERACION RESTRINGIDA (ROZ) TMA BAIRES, GND-FL245, sobre los limites laterales de la TMA BAIRES, 08-11 NOV: la operacion es supervisada por el COAe; las aeronaves que no cumplan seran consideradas transito aereo irregular (Decreto 1334/2026). Quedan suspendidas las operaciones en aerodromos y helipuertos publicos y privados no controlados, LAD y LADH dentro del area, la instruccion, los vuelos locales y las actividades recreativas y deportivas (paracaidismo, planeadores, globos, parapentes); se prohiben los UAS/RPAS; Moron (SADM) y el helipuerto Dr. Alfredo Lanari tienen restricciones propias. Periodos (UTC): 8 NOV 13:00Z hasta la puesta del sol; 9 NOV 11:00Z-20:00Z; 10 NOV 09:30Z-12:00Z y 18:00Z-21:30Z; 11 NOV 10:00Z-19:00Z (hora local = UTC-3). El 11 NOV la ROZ tambien rige (10:00Z-19:00Z), con el area militar FAOR MERCEDES. Aeroparque (SABE), Ezeiza (SAEZ) y Cordoba (SACO) tienen sus propias ventanas de cierre: ver SUP A 255/26 seccion 2. Lea los SUP para el texto completo. Solo de referencia, no es un NOTAM oficial."
   }
  },
