    "upper": {
     "text": "FL245",
     "feet": 24500,
     "reference": "FL"
    },
    "text": "SUP A 258/26 and SUP A 255/26 (ANAC) - VISIT OF POPE LEO XIV. RESTRICTED OPERATION ZONE (ROZ) TMA CBA, GND-FL245, over the lateral limits of the TMA CORDOBA, TUE 10 NOV 2026 09:30Z-21:00Z (local 06:30-18:00): operations are supervised by the COAe; aircraft that do not comply are treated as irregular air traffic (Decree 1334/2026). Operations are suspended at uncontrolled aerodromes and heliports, LAD and LADH inside the area; instruction, recreational and sport activities and UAS/RPAS are prohibited. On 10 NOV the training restricted areas SAR 56, 57, 58 and 59 (Escuela de Aviacion Militar) are the interceptor fighter area FAOR EAM (SUP A 258/26; the SUP gives no separate limits). Read the SUPs for the full text. Reference only, not an official NOTAM.",
    "textEs": "SUP A 258/26 y SUP A 255/26 (ANAC) - VISITA DEL PAPA LEON XIV. ZONA DE OPERACION RESTRINGIDA (ROZ) TMA CBA, GND-FL245, sobre los limites laterales de la TMA CORDOBA, MARTES 10 NOV 2026 09:30Z-21:00Z (local 06:30-18:00): la operacion es supervisada por el COAe; las aeronaves que no cumplan seran consideradas transito aereo irregular (Decreto 1334/2026). Quedan suspendidas las operaciones en aerodromos y helipuertos no controlados, LAD y LADH dentro del area; se prohiben la instruccion, las actividades recreativas y deportivas y los UAS/RPAS. El 10 NOV los restringidos Escuela SAR 56, 57, 58 y 59 (Escuela de Aviacion Militar) son el area de la caza interceptora FAOR EAM (SUP A 258/26; el SUP no da limites propios). Lea los SUP para el texto completo. Solo de referencia, no es un NOTAM oficial."
   }
